#: kcmfontinst/KCmFontInst.cpp:368
msgid ""
"<h1>Font Installer</h1>"
"<p> This module allows you to install TrueType, Type1, Speedo, and Bitmap "
"fonts.</p>"
"<p>"
"You may also install fonts using Konqueror: type fonts:/ into Konqueror's "
"location bar and this will display your installed fonts. To install a font, "
"simply copy one into the appropriate folder.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Gosodydd Wynebfathau</h1>"
"<p> Caniatâ'r modiwl i chi osod wynebfathau TrueType, Type1, Speedo, a "
"Bitmap.</p>"
"<p>"
"Cewch hefyd osod wynebfathau gan ddefnyddio Konqueror: teipiwch fonts:/ i "
"mewn i bar lleoliad Konqueror a bydd hyn yn dangos eich wynebfathau "
"gosodiedig.  Er mwyn gosod wynebfath, copiwch un i mewn i'r blygell "
"addas.</p>"

#: kcmfontinst/KCmFontInst.cpp:374
msgid ""
"<p><b>NOTE:</b> As you are not logged in as \"root\", any fonts installed "
"will only be available to you. To install fonts system wide, use the "
"\"Administrator Mode\" button to run this module as \"root\".</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>NODER:</b>"
" Gan nad ydych wedi mewngofnodi fel \"root\" (gwraidd), bydd unrhyw "
"wynebfath a osodir ar gael i chi yn unig.  Er mwyn gosod wynebfathau ar "
"gyfer yr holl gysawd, defnyddiwch y botwm \"Modd Gwasanaethwr\" i redeg y "
"modiwl fel \"root\".</p>"

